                    },
                    "message": "I'd suggest using partial matches on OWNERS at the root directory.  That's how we manage most repositories.  OWNERS files are recursive, but it seems to be easier for people to see it all in one spot.\n\nThe only repository with non-root OWNERS files is google-misc."
                },
                {
                    "file": "oem/example/OWNERS",
                    "line": 1,
